-- InterviewType: PHONE, VIDEO, IN_PERSON, TECHNICAL, BEHAVIORAL, PANEL, FINAL
-- InterviewStatus: SCHEDULED, COMPLETED, CANCELLED, RESCHEDULED, NO_SHOW
-- MessageStatus: SENT, DELIVERED, READ
